 s\, Sommore offers audiences a hilarious\, yet piercing look at today's iss
 ues from a woman’s perspective. She is frank and fearless in her routines
 \, tackling topics that range from the mundane to the controversial with wi
 t\, intelligence and style.\n\nPraised by critics\, respected by her peers\
 , and adored by a diverse fan base\, she performs her stand-up act to sold-
 out audiences across the country\, and she is among the top-grossing stand-
 up comediennes in the United States and abroad. Oprah Winfrey proclaimed he
 r “a force to be reckoned with in the new millennium.”\n\nSommore is in
 credibly talented\, hilarious and has made a mark in every genre of enterta
 inment. The self-proclaimed "Chandelier" can be seen in films such as “Fr
 iday after Next"\, "Soul Plane"\, "Something New" and television series inc
 luding the Academy Award-winning series “The Parkers” and "The Hughleys
 ”.\n\nShe has been a featured guest on “The Oprah Winfrey Show\,” “
 The Tonight Show with Jay Leno\,” “The View” and “Politically Incor
 rect with Bill Maher.” She was also interviewed on CNN Headline News abou
 t her phenomenal artistic and financial success as a comedienne\, and was p
 rofiled in Comedy Central’s “Special Women in Comedy” program.\n\nSom
 more has wrote\, self produced\, and performed in her own one woman Comedy 
 Specials\, “The Queen Stands Alone" (2008/Comedy Central)\, "Chandelier S
 tatus" (2013/Showtime)\, “The Reign Continues" (2015/Showtime)\, "A Queen
  with No Spades" (2018/Showtime) and the most recently “Queen Chandelier
 ” (2023/Netflix). She also self produced and hosted “All the Queens Men
 ” (2018/BET)\, a quartet of her opening acts she hand-picked to feature i
 n a network televised production.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 prem
 ium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Tic
 ket…\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event
